---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { listedPosts, fullTitle, formatDate } from './_posts.js';

// jeyanandan.com -- Jason's personal site, and only that.
//
// 2026-09-24: reordered, at Jason's request. The old page led with Fuckery,
// the most obscure thing here, and that was the wrong first impression. New
// order: who I am, in one line -> what I am working on right now
// (formaddie.com, the most prominent thing on the page) -> the initiatives,
// as a set, in a tile grid, so the whole shape is visible at a glance -> the
// writing, given real prominence instead of a footnote -> the Ko-fi
// disclosure and link. Jason's own lines run through the page between
// sections, as punctuation, spread out rather than clustered. Nothing is
// hidden: Fuckery is still on the page, it is just not the opening line.
//
// THE WRITING LIST IS GENERATED. It reads listedPosts (and fullTitle,
// formatDate) from ./_posts.js, the same module /blog/ and /sitemap.xml
// read, so an unlisted post (fuckarian, the-constraint) cannot appear here
// while it is hidden there. fullTitle joins title and subtitle the same way
// the rest of the site does, so a change to that join happens in one place.
//
// MADDIE. The only formaddie.com content on this page is the feature card
// below: the bristlecone mark, one paragraph and the outbound link. The
// demonstration, the recorder, the privacy policy, sign-in and the auth
// callbacks stay off the site; they are kept, unbuilt, in src/_suppressed/
// and the recorder component, unimported, at src/components/Talk.astro. Read
// src/_suppressed/README.md before restoring any of it. The mark is
// self-hosted under /assets/ because the CSP is img-src 'self' data:. Do not
// swap in formaddie-rabbit.svg: its fill is near-white and it disappears on
// this paper background.
//
// TWO DEPLOY GATES. deploy-jeyanandan.yml greps the BUILT page for:
//
//     not the Foundation and not the company.
//     ko-fi.com/jeyanandan
//
// The first is the end of the hero paragraph, the second is the closing
// link's href. Both must stay real body text (real markup, not a comment)
// on one source line each. Reword either and the workflow has to change in
// the same change-set, workflow first.
//
// 2026-09-28: LinkedIn is the reference for Jason himself. The opening quote
// links to his LinkedIn profile (its About section opens with the same idea),
// and the site footer in Base.astro carries a LinkedIn link on every page. The
// closing line is his saying as he says it: "a being that just happens to be
// human".
//
// 2026-09-28 (later): names without the article, as Jason uses them --
// "DAX Foundation" and "Constraint Protocol", not "The ...".
//
// Comments in the markup below are {/* ... */}, never <!-- ... -->. Astro
// emits an HTML comment nested inside an element straight into the built
// page, and a gate sentence living in a shipped comment would pass the grep
// happily while the paragraph it was meant to guard was gone.
---
<Base
  title="Jason Jeyanandan"
  description="I build things, mostly for myself first, and publish the ones that hold up."
>
  <section class="hero"><div class="shell narrow">
    <h1>Jason Jeyanandan</h1>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <p class="lede">I build things, mostly for myself first, and publish the ones that hold up. This is my personal site — not the Foundation and not the company.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="quote-band"><div class="shell narrow">
    <p class="quote"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonjeyanandan" title="Jason Jeyanandan on LinkedIn">"If you're not failing, you're not succeeding."</a></p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="feature"><div class="shell narrow">
    <h2 class="eyebrow">Working on now</h2>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <a class="mark" href="https://formaddie.com"><img src="/assets/formaddie-bristlecone.png" width="140" height="145" alt="formaddie.com" /></a>
      <div class="feature-body">
        <h3 class="feature-title"><a href="https://formaddie.com">formaddie.com</a></h3>
        <p class="feature-date">Released <time datetime="2026-09-21">21 September 2026</time></p>
        <p class="feature-lede">A senior-facing <a href="https://daxfoundation.org/#cognitive-companion">cognitive companion</a> that turns a life into a memoir by talking. Built at <a href="https://www.obsidiandelta.com">Obsidian Delta</a>.</p>
        <p class="feature-tag">"Your stories will live forever."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="quote-band"><div class="shell narrow">
    <p class="quote"><em>Per aspera ad astra</em> — through hardship, to the stars. The hardship is the route.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section><div class="shell">
    <h2 class="eyebrow">Initiatives</h2>
    <div class="tiles">
      <div class="tile">
        <p class="tile-kind">Foundation</p>
        <h3><a href="https://daxfoundation.org">DAX Foundation</a></h3>
        <p>The mission, and the constraint it answers to — DAX, the preservation and expansion of life, humanity, and consciousness — kept apart from the company that builds the infrastructure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile">
        <p class="tile-kind">Company</p>
        <h3><a href="https://www.obsidiandelta.com">Obsidian Delta</a></h3>
        <p>The company. Builds the cognition.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile">
        <p class="tile-kind">Public working draft</p>
        <h3><a href="https://github.com/daxfoundation/constraint-protocol">Constraint Protocol</a></h3>
        <p>A signed record nobody can quietly edit, and a way for a person, a company or a piece of software to declare in advance what it will not do — and be checked against it. v0.5.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile">
        <p class="tile-kind">Metacognitive framework</p>
        <h3><a href="https://github.com/ObsidianDelta/Fuckery">Fuckery</a></h3>
        <p>Structure forms under constraint, then becomes the constraint on whatever forms next. Named so that nobody genuflects at it. v0.51, CC BY 4.0.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile coming">
        <p class="tile-kind">Learning initiative</p>
        <h3>Meta DAX</h3>
        <p>DAX Foundation's universal learning initiative.</p>
        <span class="badge">Coming</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="quote-band"><div class="shell narrow">
    <p class="quote">"If you don't fight for your love, what kind of love do you have?"</p>
  </div></section>

  {listedPosts.length > 0 && (
    <section><div class="shell narrow">
      <h2 class="eyebrow">Writing</h2>
      <ul class="posts">
        {listedPosts.map((p) => (
          <li>
            <a href={`/blog/${p.slug}/`}>{fullTitle(p)}</a>
            <time datetime={new Date(p.date).toISOString()}>{formatDate(p.date)}</time>
            {p.description && <p>{p.description}</p>}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div></section>
  )}

  <section class="quote-band"><div class="shell narrow">
    <p class="quote">"Wealth is not how much money I have. It is how happy and well off the people I love are."</p>
  </div></section>

  <section><div class="shell narrow">
    <p>If any of this is useful to you, <a href="https://ko-fi.com/jeyanandan">buy me a coffee</a>.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="quote-band"><div class="shell narrow">
    <p class="quote">"I am a being that just happens to be human."</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>

<style is:global>
.hero{padding:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,4.5rem) 0 clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem)}
.lede{font-size:clamp(19px,2.2vw,21px);margin:0}
section + section{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem) 0}
section p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
section a{text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:.16em}
section a:hover{color:var(--orange)}
section strong{font-weight:600;color:var(--strong)}

/* ---------- quotes: punctuation between sections, not clustered ---------- */
.quote-band{padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.25rem) 0}
.quote-band .narrow{max-width:30rem}
.quote{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2.4vw,1.25rem);line-height:1.55;color:var(--soft);text-align:center;margin:0}
.quote em{font-style:italic}
.quote a{color:inherit;text-decoration-color:var(--line)}
.quote a:hover{color:var(--orange);text-decoration-color:currentColor}

/* ---------- working on now: the lead feature ---------- */
.feature-card{
  display:flex;gap:1.75rem;align-items:flex-start;
  margin-top:.5rem;
  background:var(--card);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-top:3px solid var(--orange);
  border-radius:6px;
  padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.5rem);
}
.feature-card .mark{flex:0 0 auto;display:block;line-height:0}
.feature-card img{display:block;width:140px;max-width:100%;height:auto}
.feature-body{min-width:0}
.feature-title{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4.5vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 .4rem;color:var(--strong)}
.feature-title a{text-decoration:none}
.feature-title a:hover{color:var(--orange)}
.feature-date{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 1.1rem}
.feature-lede{font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,19px);margin:0 0 1rem}
.feature-tag{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--orange);margin:0}
@media (max-width:600px){
  .feature-card{flex-direction:column;gap:1.1rem;padding:1.5rem}
  .feature-card img{width:110px}
}

/* ---------- initiatives: tile grid, the whole shape at a glance ---------- */
.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:1.1rem;margin-top:.25rem}
.tile{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;
  padding:1.4rem 1.5rem 1.6rem;
}
.tile.coming{border-style:dashed}
.tile-kind{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--orange);margin:0 0 .55rem}
.tile h3{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 .55rem;color:var(--strong)}
.tile h3 a{text-decoration:none}
.tile h3 a:hover{color:var(--orange)}
.tile p{font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.55;margin:0;color:var(--ink)}
.tile .badge{
  align-self:flex-start;margin-top:.9rem;
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--orange);border:1px solid var(--orange);border-radius:3px;padding:.2rem .45rem;
}

/* ---------- writing, given real prominence ---------- */
.posts{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem}
.posts li{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:1.1rem}
.posts li:first-child{border-top:none;padding-top:0}
.posts a{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.3;color:var(--strong);text-decoration:none;display:block}
.posts a:hover{color:var(--orange)}
.posts time{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-top:.4rem}
.posts p{margin:.6rem 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
</style>
